BuildFreetokenForSpeed

This repository includes an unmodified source snapshot of FreeToken from
https://github.com/FlashML-org/FreeToken at commit
078132480ea4a0424f677a27eb22085624d331e6, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The upstream LICENSE and contributor documents are retained in upstream/FreeToken.

Local modifications are distributed separately in patches/series and are
identified in patches/series.json and docs/changes.md. The customized wheel
0.1.3+speed.win1 is a Speed build, not an official FreeToken distribution.
Repository-owned tooling and patches are provided under the root Apache-2.0
LICENSE. Model weights are not included. Third-party runtime dependencies
must be obtained and distributed under their own licenses.

The strataq2dev4 research patch also includes adapted CUDA components from
https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata at commit
6674a0065fb96bacde33e3eb10f91a1df86f95f2, and its pinned ggml-derived code at
3cf03257f219afbe7334045ff7c6a06ac68c627d. These components retain their MIT
licenses and attribution; the repository's Apache-2.0 license does not replace
them. The replayed FreeToken source contains LICENSE-strata.txt,
LICENSE-ggml.txt and per-file provenance in
python/freetoken/kernel/csrc/third_party/strata_mmvq/UPSTREAM.json.
The corresponding wheel includes those license files. This integrates native
kernels into FreeToken and does not distribute or replace it with the Strata
inference engine. Model weights are not included.
